Add logging and profiler markers to the Chromium interception code and LowerToken.

We don't add SYSCALL_BROKERING macros to CallNtOpenProcessTokenEx, as it is a
non-Target* helper and threading them through it isn't worth it. The token
ACL retains the user's own SID plus the sandbox random SID, so both normal
and restricted checks pass regardless.

Originally landed as changset:
https://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/rev/0f763c186855

